      "record_sha256": "f6509f308a1e63820017d0d2ab44aa8fe71aa3bc7d8f30557679de68c1c0a8cc",
      "text": "{\n  \"op\": \"write_workspace\",\n  \"name\": \"notes.md\",\n  \"text\": \"Starting a story about a young adventurer named Elara who discovers a mysterious map leading to an ancient treasure. She sets out on a quest to uncover the secrets of the map.\"\n}"
