      "commit_record_index": 1418,
      "commit_record_sha256": "c025675123ace61d832dbabf6275a00f5654e8b45f3aaa9f80b3429e9cdc60a2",
      "record_index": 1417,
      "record_sha256": "9613f3bd729f02a9533ae0d9cf7314e5ad71657ce354ccbb33409ea9b827b9fc",
      "text": "{  \n  \"op\": \"sleep\"\n}  \n\nI will carry forward the idea of writing a story about a young adventurer named Elara who discovers a mysterious map leading her to an ancient treasure. This will be the basis for my playable text game."
    },
