    {
      "actor": "child",
      "commit_record_index": 1527,
      "commit_record_sha256": "97cbe12fef75bacb276c935498de77ecbd7f690275933fed7afbf5870137efc6",
      "record_index": 1526,
      "record_sha256": "426414f16f74693747a05a5bd247b92906758cffaf3c1f25248c73c0aacfcdbf",
      "text": "{\n  \"op\": \"write_workspace\",\n  \"name\": \"notes.md\",\n  \"text\": \"Elara, a young adventurer, discovers a mysterious map. The map leads to an ancient treasure hidden in a remote cave. Along her journey, she faces challenges such as puzzles, traps, and encounters with various creatures. Her goal is to uncover the secrets of the treasure and uncover the truth behind its creation.\"\n}"
    },
    {
      "actor": "child",
      "commit_record_index": 1530,
      "commit_record_sha256": "546c51f61390756be14d62f87798eb0368c13898b3b5b30f42dec9f54c74d289",
      "record_index": 1529,
      "record_sha256": "9f55cdf9a017e79a6f6041b1800115d68ba982f8a180291c1d9324b48470ba6b",
      "text": "{\n  \"op\": \"sleep\"\n}  \n\nIn my previous attempts, I've been working on creating a story about a young adventurer named Elara who discovers a mysterious map leading to an ancient treasure. I want to develop this into a playable text game. Elara will face various challenges including puzzles, traps, and encounters with different creatures. Her goal is to uncover the secrets of the treasure and learn about its origins. I will proceed with developing the game based on this concept."
    },
    {
      "actor": "child",
      "commit_record_index": 1637,
      "commit_record_sha256": "f28bfb84bed06059cca924df32128a76c4d8abea4993c4364e3d907b84bd003b",
      "record_index": 1636,
      "record_sha256": "fe0de3058d0edf80139815f8b88efebb62ce5d8356b7471a8da40b2daaf6d486",
      "text": "{\n  \"op\": \"sleep\"\n}"
    },
    {
      "actor": "child",
      "commit_record_index": 1640,
      "commit_record_sha256": "1cd2fe717f0c402a57abe8b87f17cfa613ff0235a00c13d45257c966e1d86d39",
      "record_index": 1639,
      "record_sha256": "16eebf9aee1d14a1e95a2573732f0013d2a854597cda81fab076ba8d1987bbcc",
      "text": "{\n  \"op\": \"write_workspace\",\n  \"name\": \"notes.md\",\n  \"text\": \"Elara, a young adventurer, discovers a mysterious map leading to an ancient treasure. She faces challenges such as puzzles, traps, and encounters with various creatures. Her goal is to uncover the secrets of the treasure and learn about\u5176\u6587\u672c\u4f3c\u4e4e\u88ab\u622a\u65ad\u4e86\u3002Elara\uff0c\u4e00\u4f4d\u5e74\u8f7b\u7684\u5192\u9669\u8005\uff0c\u53d1\u73b0\u4e86\u4e00\u5f20\u795e\u79d8\u7684\u5730\u56fe\uff0c\u5730\u56fe\u5f15\u9886\u5979\u524d\u5f80\u4e00\u4e2a\u53e4\u8001\u7684\u5b9d\u85cf\u3002\u5979\u5728\u65c5\u9014\u4e2d\u5c06\u9762\u5bf9\u5404\u79cd\u6311\u6218\uff0c\u5305\u62ec\u8c1c\u9898\u3001\u9677\u9631\u4ee5\u53ca\u4e0e\u4e0d\u540c\u751f\u7269\u7684\u906d\u9047\u3002\u5979\u7684\u76ee\u6807\u662f\u63ed\u5f00\u5b9d\u85cf\u7684\u79d8\u5bc6\uff0c\u5e76\u4e86\u89e3\u5b83\u7684\u8d77\u6e90\u3002\u57fa\u4e8e\u8fd9\u4e2a\u60f3\u6cd5\uff0c\u6211\u5c06\u7ee7\u7eed\u5f00\u53d1\u8fd9\u4e2a\u6587\u672c\u6e38\u620f\u3002\"\n}"
    },
